Through these website projects, I established a new creative workflow that combines web development with AI-powered tools to build more engaging and interactive digital experiences. By integrating technologies such as AI image and video generation, conversational AI, 3D web experiences, and AI-driven software control through MCP workflows, I explored how emerging tools can work together within a unified pipeline. This approach enables the creation of richer interactions, more dynamic user experiences, and innovative web applications that go beyond traditional websites, transforming them into intelligent, immersive, and highly interactive digital products.

